<x:xmpmeta xmlns:x="adobe:ns:meta/">
  <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#">
    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">A duty to fulfil</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;You do not have to have seen / read Bridgerton to be able to read this! :)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Adora Grayskull is expected to find a perfect bride this Season, and Perfuma of Halfmoon checks every box. But when Adora unknowingly crosses paths with Perfumaâ€™s fiercely protective sister, Catra, sparks fly on horseback and tension brews in the ballroom. Neither of them planned on falling in love, least of all with each other.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;OR&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Adora is looking for a wife this season, and her requirements are hefty. Once she meets Perfuma- who meets her expectations exactly, she can't help but feel a pull towards the woman's fiery sister, Catra.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
